 "note": "The one source for events and commands. It is in the bundle (AgentOffice.schema, AgentOffice.validate), in index.d.ts, in Reference.md and in kit/schema.json, kept in step by hand. common lists the fields every event can carry. Field types: string, number, boolean, object, Status, string[], object[], a name from enums (the value must be one of the list) or a name from types (an object with the listed fields; other fields are reported); a trailing ? means optional."
